  "label": "Meme Harm Potential",
  "description": "The meme format 'officer down' can be considered harmful because it trivializes a phrase with real-world consequences. While often used for humor, it may be perceived as disrespectful or insensitive, especially when used in contexts that mock real-life tragedies involving police officers. The meme's intent is primarily satirical, but its potential to cause harm arises from the real-world gravity of the phrase.",
